  ["item.silver-chalice-set-with-moonstones.xdmg2024"]={title="Silver chalice set with moonstones",subtitle="Item - XDMG - 2024",body="Pagina: 215\n\nRaridade: none"},
  ["magicitem.silver-dragon-scale-mail.dmg2014"]={title="Silver Dragon Scale Mail",subtitle="Item Magico - DMG - 2014",body="Pagina: 165\n\nRaridade: very rare\n\nSintonizacao: Sim\n\nValor padrao 2024: 40000 PO\n\nCrafting 2024: 20000 PO / 125 dias\n\nDragon scale mail is made of the scales of one kind of dragon. Sometimes dragons collect their cast-off scales and gift them to humanoids. Other times, hunters carefully skin and preserve the hide of a dead dragon. In either case, dragon scale mail is highly valued. While wearing this armor, you gain a +1 bonus to AC, you have advantage on saving throws against the Frightful Presence and breath weapons of dragons, and you have resistance to cold damage.\n\nAdditionally, you can focus your senses as an action to magically discern the distance and direction to the closest silver dragon within 30 miles of you. This special action can't be used again until the next dawn."},
  ["magicitem.silver-dragon-scale-mail.xdmg2024"]={title="Silver Dragon Scale Mail",subtitle="Item Magico - XDMG - 2024",body="Pagina: 254\n\nRaridade: very rare\n\nSintonizacao: Sim\n\nValor padrao 2024: 40000 PO\n\nCrafting 2024: 20000 PO / 125 dias\n\n{#itemEntry Dragon Scale Mail|XDMG"},
  ["creature.silver-dragon-wyrmling.mm2014"]={title="Silver Dragon Wyrmling",subtitle="Criatura - MM - 2014",body="Pagina: 118\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nTipo/Tamanho: dragon / M\n\nCR: 2\n\nCA: 17\n\nPV: 45 (6d8 + 18)\n\nDeslocamento: walk: 30, fly: 60\n\nSTR 19 | DEX 10 | CON 17 | INT 12 | WIS 11 | CHA 15\n\nSalvamentos: \n\nPericias: \n\nSentidos: blindsight 10 ft., darkvision 60 ft.\n\nIdiomas: Draconic\n\nImunidades: cold\n\n=== ACOES ===\n\nBite\n\nmw 6 to hit, reach 5 ft., one target. h9 (1d10 + 4) piercing damage.\n\nBreath Weapons {@recharge 5}\n\nThe dragon uses one of the following breath weapons.\n\n• Cold Breath\n\n• Paralyzing Breath"},
  ["creature.silver-dragon-wyrmling.xmm2024"]={title="Silver Dragon Wyrmling",subtitle="Criatura - XMM - 2024",body="Pagina: 278\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nTipo/Tamanho: dragon / M\n\nCR: 2\n\nCA: 17\n\nPV: 45 (6d8 + 18)\n\nDeslocamento: walk: 30, fly: 60\n\nSTR 19 | DEX 10 | CON 17 | INT 12 | WIS 11 | CHA 15\n\nSalvamentos: \n\nPericias: \n\nSentidos: Blindsight 10 ft., Darkvision 60 ft.\n\nIdiomas: Draconic\n\nImunidades: cold\n\n=== ACOES ===\n\nMultiattack\n\nThe dragon makes two Rend attacks.\n\nRend\n\nm 6, reach 5 ft. h9 (1d10 + 4) Piercing damage.\n\nCold Breath {@recharge 5}\n\ncon 13, each creature in a 15-foot XPHB. actSaveFail 18 (4d8) Cold damage. actSaveSuccess Half damage.\n\nParalyzing Breath\n\ncon 13, each creature in a 15-foot XPHB. 1 The target has the XPHB condition until the end of its next turn, when it repeats the save. 2 The target has the XPHB condition, and it repeats the save at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success. After 1 minute, it succeeds automatically."},
  ["item.silver-ewer.dmg2014"]={title="Silver ewer",subtitle="Item - DMG - 2014",body="Pagina: 134\n\nRaridade: none"},
  ["item.silver-ewer.xdmg2024"]={title="Silver ewer",subtitle="Item - XDMG - 2024",body="Pagina: 215\n\nRaridade: none"},
  ["creature.silver-greatwyrm.ftd2014"]={title="Silver Greatwyrm",subtitle="Criatura - FTD - 2014",body="Pagina: 208\n\n=== ESTATISTICAS ===\n\nTipo/Tamanho: dragon / G\n\nCR: 28\n\nCA: 22\n\nPV: 565 (29d20 + 261)\n\nDeslocamento: walk: 60, burrow: 60, fly: 120, swim: 60\n\nSTR 30 | DEX 16 | CON 29 | INT 21 | WIS 22 | CHA 30\n\nSalvamentos: \n\nPericias: \n\nSentidos: truesight 120 ft.\n\nIdiomas: Common, Draconic\n\nImunidades: cold\n\nImunidades a condicoes: charmed, frightened, poisoned\n\n=== TRACOS ===\n\nLegendary Resistance (4/Day)\n\nIf the greatwyrm fails a saving throw, it can choose to succeed instead.\n\nMetallic Awakening (Recharges after a Short or Long Rest)\n\nIf the greatwyrm would be reduced to 0 hit points, its current hit point total instead resets to 450 hit points, it recharges its Breath Weapon, and it regains any expended uses of Legendary Resistance. Additionally, the greatwyrm can now use the options in the \"Mythic Actions\" section for 1 hour. Award a party an additional 120,000 XP (240,000 XP total) for defeating the greatwyrm after its Metallic Awakening activates.\n\nUnusual Nature\n\nThe greatwyrm doesn't require food or drink.\n\n=== ACOES ===\n\nMultiattack\n\nThe greatwyrm makes one Bite attack and two Claw attacks.\n\nBite\n\nmw 18 to hit, reach 15 ft., one target. h21 (2d10 + 10) piercing damage plus 13 (2d12) force damage.\n\nClaw\n\nmw 18 to hit, reach 10 ft., one target. h19 (2d8 + 10) slashing damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature, it is grappled (escape 20) and is restrained until this grapple ends. The greatwyrm can have only one creature grappled in this way at a time.\n\nTail\n\nmw 18 to hit, reach 20 ft., one target. h21 (2d10 + 10) bludgeoning damage. If the target is a creature, it must succeed on a 26 Strength saving throw or be knocked prone.\n\nBreath Weapon {@recharge 5}\n\nThe greatwyrm uses one of the following breath weapons:\n\n• Elemental Breath The greatwyrm exhales elemental energy in a 300-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a 25 Dexterity saving throw, taking 84 (13d12) cold damage on a failed save, or half as much damage on a successful one.\n\n• Sapping Breath The greatwyrm exhales gas in a 300-foot cone. Each creature in that area must make a 25 Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, the creature falls unconscious for 1 minute. On a successful save, the creature has disadvantage on attack rolls and saving throws until the end of the greatwyrm's next turn. An unconscious creature can repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns, ending the effect on itself on a success.\n\nChange Shape\n\nThe greatwyrm magically transforms into any creature that is Medium or Small, while retaining its game statistics (other than its size). This transformation ends if the dragon is reduced to 0 hit points or uses its action to end it.\n\n=== ACOES LENDARIAS ===\n\nAttack\n\nThe greatwyrm makes one Claw or Tail attack.\n\nWing Attack (Costs 2 Actions)\n\nThe greatwyrm beats its wings. Each creature within 30 feet of it must succeed on a 26 Dexterity saving throw or take 17 (2d6 + 10) bludgeoning damage and be knocked prone. The greatwyrm can then fly up to half its flying speed.\n\n=== ACOES MITICAS ===\n\nBite\n\nThe greatwyrm makes one Bite attack.\n\nShattering Roar (Costs 2 Actions)\n\nThe greatwyrm unleashes a magical roar. Each creature in a 120-foot-radius sphere centered on the greatwyrm must succeed on a 26 Constitution saving throw or take 19 (3d12) thunder damage and be incapacitated until the end of its next turn."},
